          "author": "Enid Blyton",
          "description": "Set off a magical adventure with the first book in Enid Blyton's classic fantasy series about a chair that can fly and grant wishes! \n\nWhen Mollie and Peter go to buy their mother a birthday present, they discover the most extraordinary thing: a magical wishing-chair! The Wishing-Chair takes them on some wonderful adventures – to a giant's castle to rescue a new pixie friend, to the Land of Dreams, and even to a disappearing island! Who knows what might happen next? ",
